        <mxCell id="enc_detail" value="A) Encoder Block 简化&#xa;&#xa;x → KPConvX / DA-KPConvX → Norm + Act → + Shortcut → y&#xa;&#xa;DA-Radius: 先改变 neighbors；DA-Kernel: 改变 kernel influence；两者独立消融。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 6;fillColor=#0d1117;strokeColor=#8b949e;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=15;align=left;spacingLeft=18;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="55" y="800" width="620" height="155" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dec_detail" value="B) Decoder Block 简化&#xa;&#xa;Up → Concat(skip) → Unary / KPConvX → + Shortcut → y&#xa;&#xa;Decoder 主要保持原 KPConvX 结构，避免过多改动影响稳定性。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 6;fillColor=#0d1117;strokeColor=#8b949e;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=15;align=left;spacingLeft=18;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="720" y="800" width="620" height="155" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="paper_note" value="核心论文表述&#xa;&#xa;Kernel point scaling changes local weighting,&#xa;while DA-Radius changes the effective receptive field&#xa;at neighborhood construction time.&#xa;&#xa;Local DA-Radius + Serialized Global Context = paper-level 主线" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 6;fillColor=#17100a;strokeColor=#f0883e;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=15;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
